+/* PROJECTOR PLACEMENT: sidebar-docked projectors
+ *
+ * A projector with placement=Sidebar leaves a chip at the code site and
+ * renders its primary UI in the projectors sidebar panel. The chip is one
+ * fixed glyph (ProjectorChip.glyph), the same for every kind, styled
+ * after the fold projector: the default shard backing plus a drop shadow.
+ * It fills the box the editor reserved for it (ProjectorChip.shape), so
+ * the drawn width can't drift from the reserved width. */
+
+/* The projector div carries its kind's class, so these rules neutralize
+ * per-kind styling to make every chip look alike. */
+.projector.chipped {
+  cursor: pointer;
+  justify-content: center;
+  align-items: center;
+  background: none;
+}
+
+.projector .proj-chip {
+  display: flex;
+  align-items: center;
+  justify-content: center;
+  width: 100%;
